    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm starting to have some doubts. Is this truly something good I've done?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm starting to worry, Mayer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "About what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In the past, I always believed that as long as I gave my effort to any problem, it'd always be answerable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this time, I fear I've run against a problem I have no way to answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you can't solve it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not that I can't solve it. It's that I don't dare to. I don't dare to pull it apart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mayer, did Kafka ever tell you how she and I know each other?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Didja forget? She remembers she even mentioned it while talking to Mina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mayer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
        "name2": "char_242_mayer#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
